cranialflora-initialinfestor-role-greeting = Your brain has been completely taken over by the cranial flora. Pretend that nothing happened, and spread your infection.
cranialflora-healing = You feel a root system feed your body.
cranialflora-infection-warning = You feel movement in your head.
cranialflora-infection-underway = You feel something ingraining in your head.

